    "updated_at": "2018-05-17T17:10:37Z",
    "body": "I assume you are talking about setSelectionRange, as there is no method called setSelection.\r\n\r\nThe spec doesn't proscribe UI decisions like what selection looks like, so this is up to individual browsers and their UI design.\r\n\r\nHow it \"works\" from a programming point of view is well-specified, e.g. it will update selectionStart and selectionEnd.\r\n\r\nLet me close this, as there doesn't appear to be a spec bug here, but instead you're wondering how browsers' UI works. Happy to continue discussing in the closed thread though.",
